            <title><![CDATA[Electric aviation takes off as companies seek new era of flight]]></title>
            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/electric-aviation-takes-off-as-companies-seek-new-era-of-flight</link>
            <description><![CDATA[Electric aviation is still in the very early stages of its development. But a number of companies are moving forward with more ambitious plans. In contrast to its approach with other forms of electric transportation, the Trump administration seems willing to embrace a bigger rollout. Aviation correspondent Miles O'Brien reports on the promise and the challenges of the budding industry.]]></description>
